    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## This is the setup\n####Variables\nUse the variables node to set the location of files.\n- **labelSource** = The location where the images can be found. This is the place where you copy the images you took from your phone so the automation can find them\n- **imageDest** = The location to where the label image will be copied, so your notebook can find them. This really could be any location but I like to keep images in my notebook folder so when everything syncs to the cloud my notebook still works on mobile, etc.\n- **notesLocation** = The location of my spirits notebook files.\n\nThe next two nodes look for files in the labelSource location and confirm the images are there.",
        "height": 688,
        "width": 912
      },
