    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Data extraction\nThis section processes each image by running it through Gemini vision and extracting the relevant data. It also selects a category (wine or bourbon)",
        "height": 688,
        "width": 944,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        448,
        224
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "5789e0fc-b2cc-459b-8fc9-d888b65fa3f5",
      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Note creation\nThe lasts steps are:\n1. Move the image to the final destination.\n2. Generate the markdown for the note.\n3. Add the note to the notebook folder.\n4. This repeats for every image in the source folder. \n\nYou can see that it creates a different markdown for each -->\ncategory, so this could be expanded to include any other \ncategories you want.",
        "height": 688,
        "width": 1232,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1504,
        224
